Subject: Cantor Temporal Planner and Bidirectional Change Reflection Data Design

Description: WS-CTPR-006 conceptual and logical model for Planner, Calendar, the semantic repository, ChangeCapsules, tandem lanes, compiler walks, lessons, privacy, retention, versioning, and deterministic replay. Physical storage and concurrency mechanisms remain deferred.

